# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Environment variables — NAMES ONLY. Never put real values here.
#
# LOCAL DEV:  copy this file to `.dev.vars` (git-ignored) and fill in your key
#             so `npm run dev` can call the AI on your machine.
# PRODUCTION: set this as a Cloudflare secret, NOT in this repo:
#             npx wrangler secret put OPENROUTER_API_KEY
# See CLAUDE.md Section 9.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# REQUIRED — powers the agent's calls to the AI model.
# One OpenRouter key gives access to every model (Claude, GPT, Gemini, ...).
# Get one at https://openrouter.ai. Do NOT commit it.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# OPTIONAL — override the model locally. Normally set in wrangler.jsonc (vars.MODEL).
# MODEL=
